                                                               ; weight whenever t is set; CONVENTIONS section 5
                                                               ; carries the entry;
;
                                                               ; THIS IS THE KERNEL idiom/xor32 and idiom/xor64 also
                                                               ; carry  down to the character; they are not yet built
                                                               ; on it  which HANDOFF records as held out of the
